}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T18:35:19-07:00","id":1400608,"title":"","content":"Rule of cool dictates... YES.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-02T23:51:14-07:00","id":1400651,"title":"","content":"The Prince of Iron and Fire had Savant 5. So when the Past Lives 5 Zenith came to put the old Circle back together it was pretty much &quot;you son of a bitch, I'm in&quot;.<br /> <br /> Cynis Ganan has yet to meet a Solar Anathema. That said, as a scholar of some renown it is his professional opinion that the Deathknights and the Solar Anathema are in fact one-and-the-same. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1341506-dynasty-of-dovak-campaign-notes-and-play-report?p=1354933#post1354933\">He reacted with single-minded brutish violence on meeting his first Deathknight</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 07-03-2020, 06:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T00:07:38-07:00","id":1400655,"title":"","content":"You all have PCs?!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T02:31:34-07:00","id":1400666,"title":"","content":"The first Solars the Knight Raiton met after Exalting were a brother-and-sister assassin pair. He recognized the sister as the notorious Invisible Horse Princess.<br /> <br /> When she killed an ensorcelled mortal in self-defense, Knight Raiton provided testimony to clear her (because he suspected that if the mortal authorities there tried to bring her in, she\u2019d probably kill all of them).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T02:40:34-07:00","id":1400669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1400606-how-did-your-pc-react-to-meeting-a-solar-for-the-1st-time?p=1400651#post1400651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Prince of Iron and Fire had Savant 5. So when the Past Lives 5 Zenith came to put he old Circle back together it was pretty much &quot;you son of a bitch, I'm in&quot;.<br /> <br /> Cynis Ganan has yet to meet a Solar Anathema. That said, as a scholar of some renown it is his professional opinion that the Deathknights and the Solar Anathema are in fact one-and-the-same. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1341506-dynasty-of-dovak-campaign-notes-and-play-report?p=1354933#post1354933\">He reacted with single-minded brutish violence on meeting his first Deathknight</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Savant? I don't remember that mechanic. What's it do?<br /> <br /> When <b>Smiling Tiger</b> met the SOLAR <b>Peleps Bael</b>, Tiger was planning on murdering him. Tiger has a Defining Intimacy to kill dynasts who try to muscle in on the criminal underworld, and he thought the Pirate Lord Bael was a Deeb so he snuck aboard the ship to kill the Peleps dog. While canvassing for info, a looselipped sailor let slip that Bael had a shiny forehead mark when he went big and Tiger put 2 and 2 together. <br /> <br /> The Unequaled Artifact Maker <b>Salazan of Salambrimga, </b>also known as <b>Salazan of the Black Anvil</b> or <b>The Demon Forgemaster </b>met the entire circle, he more or less didn't give a shit and continued to do fantasy coke off of a moonsilver mirror. Salazan makes his money off of Dynast commissions and his Solar exaltation is more or less as &quot;don't ask and we won't have a problem&quot; among the Great Houses. I patterned that off of Lord of War, where the CIA, KGB, MI5 and the rest <i>know</i> that Nic Cage is an arms dealer but they let him deal arms because they need someone who can do the stuff that they don't want traced back to them. Sure, Salazan is probably an anathema, but he's too useful to kill and as long as no one makes a big deal out of it we won't lose a source of easy artifact weapons. <br /> <br /> Eventually he warmed up to them as &quot;People who don't pay me but I enjoy their company&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T03:07:08-07:00","id":1400672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1400606-how-did-your-pc-react-to-meeting-a-solar-for-the-1st-time?p=1400669#post1400669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Savant? I don't remember that mechanic. What's it do?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was a cheesy merit from previous editions that gave a sizable bonus on rolls related to stuff like knowing how to build or work or fix First Age artifacts.<br /> <br /> My recollection is that it was initially introduced in 1e to give Sidereal players a leg up on actually for filling that role of being the mysterious wise mentor, but immediately every Twilight remotely interested in crafting started snagging it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-03-2020, 06:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T03:30:04-07:00","id":1400681,"title":"","content":"Savant meant you understood First Age tech, but didn't really have any real memories or emotional context that went with this knowledge.<br /> <br /> Past Lives meant you remembered your last incarnations life.<br /> <br /> So it went something like this:<br /> <br /> &quot;You don't know me but we used to be friends.&quot;<br /> &quot;Okay. I don't care.&quot;<br /> &quot;Wanna help me steal a Directional Titan? I'll let you take it apart.&quot; *glows golden*<br /> &quot;You son of a bitch, I'm in.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 07-03-2020, 08:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"